OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 50 babies affected by
OL,4,Amaternity closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FSince then 54 north Devon babies have
OL,7,Fbeen born in Exeter, with one mother
OL,8,Ffrom Exmoor saying she had to leave
OL,9,Fextra early to ensure she got to
OL,10,Fhospital.
